CATEGORIES:Poetry & Literature
DESCRIPTION:BOOKMATCH What: Get half-cut at LSH—your $45 gets you a glas
 s of prosecco\, two glasses of wine\, a $5 LSH giftcard and some time with
  a staffer\, who will try to “set you up” with a book you’ll like. P
 ersonally I like to imagine you get all three glasses at once and everyone
  is walking around the store with their hands full. Also it’s presumably
  spooky. Where: Librairie St-Henri Bookstore (4622 rue Notre-Dame Ouest). 
 When: 7pm. Who: Whoever has $45. How Much: $45. SOLD OUT ( Link )\n\nListi
 ng: https://www.discordiareview.com/p/jays-list-october-2026\nMore informa
 tion: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/bookmatch-lshb-halloween-edition-tickets
 -2002627203876
LOCATION:Librairie St-Henri Bookstore (4622 rue Notre-Dame Ouest).
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/bookmatch-lshb-halloween-edition-tickets-2
 002627203876
X-MONTREAL-LITERARY-SOURCE:jays-list
